  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:03:25.440",
      "end": "00:03:28.340",
      "text": "Hello everyone, welcome to the eighth special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:03:28.340",
      "end": "00:03:30.440",
      "text": "of the Corporate Services Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:03:30.440",
      "end": "00:03:34.080",
      "text": "At being 12 p.m., I'm going to call the meeting to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:03:34.080",
      "end": "00:03:35.700",
      "text": "I will begin, as always, by acknowledging"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:03:35.700",
      "end": "00:03:37.040",
      "text": "that the City of London is situated"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:03:37.040",
      "end": "00:03:38.940",
      "text": "on the traditional lands of the Anishinaabek,"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:03:38.940",
      "end": "00:03:42.260",
      "text": "the Haudenosaunee, the Lene Peiwak, and Adawanderin."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:03:42.260",
      "end": "00:03:43.910",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history,"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:03:43.910",
      "end": "00:03:46.430",
      "text": "languages, and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:03:46.430",
      "end": "00:03:48.440",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:03:48.440",
      "end": "00:03:49.730",
      "text": "The City of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:03:49.730",
      "end": "00:03:53.030",
      "text": "to many First Nations, M\u00e9tis, and Inuit people today."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:03:53.030",
      "end": "00:03:55.230",
      "text": "And as representatives of the people of the City of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:03:55.230",
      "end": "00:03:57.280",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity to work"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:03:57.280",
      "end": "00:03:59.570",
      "text": "and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:03:59.570",
      "end": "00:04:01.420",
      "text": "I will also remind everyone that the City of London"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:04:01.420",
      "end": "00:04:02.880",
      "text": "is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:04:02.880",
      "end": "00:04:05.990",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:04:05.990",
      "end": "00:04:07.820",
      "text": "for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:04:07.820",
      "end": "00:04:10.120",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:04:10.120",
      "end": "00:04:15.940",
      "text": "please contact csclondon.ca or 519-661-2489,"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:04:15.940",
      "end": "00:04:23.480",
      "text": "extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:04:23.480",
      "end": "00:04:24.890",
      "text": "Colleagues, we have a short agenda,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:04:24.890",
      "end": "00:04:26.610",
      "text": "so I am going to dive right in,"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:04:26.610",
      "end": "00:04:31.080",
      "text": "and item one is disclosures of pecanary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:04:31.080",
      "end": "00:04:32.740",
      "text": "I see none."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:04:32.740",
      "end": "00:04:36.190",
      "text": "There are no items on the consent agenda"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:04:36.190",
      "end": "00:04:37.300",
      "text": "and no scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:04:37.300",
      "end": "00:04:39.280",
      "text": "We just have one item for direction."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:04:39.280",
      "end": "00:04:43.190",
      "text": "This is the 2023 DaPensher issuance update."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:04:43.190",
      "end": "00:04:45.290",
      "text": "We have the report from staff,"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:04:45.290",
      "end": "00:04:49.510",
      "text": "so I will look to see if perhaps we have a mover"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:04:49.510",
      "end": "00:04:51.480",
      "text": "and a seconder to frame the debate,"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:04:51.480",
      "end": "00:04:53.520",
      "text": "and then we can move into questions and comments."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:04:53.520",
      "end": "00:04:55.520",
      "text": "Moved by Councillor Trussow,"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:04:55.520",
      "end": "00:05:00.180",
      "text": "seconded by Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:05:00.180",
      "end": "00:05:06.510",
      "text": "We'll look for any questions or comments for our staff."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:05:06.510",
      "end": "00:05:07.640",
      "text": "Councillor Trussow."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:05:07.640",
      "end": "00:05:10.410",
      "text": "Does someone understand the timing of this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:05:10.410",
      "end": "00:05:13.140",
      "text": "We don't wait for shifts in the market."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:05:13.140",
      "end": "00:05:16.270",
      "text": "We just do these regularly understanding"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:05:16.270",
      "end": "00:05:19.780",
      "text": "that it just sort of plays out over a period of time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:05:19.780",
      "end": "00:05:22.380",
      "text": "even in a volatile market."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:05:22.380",
      "end": "00:05:25.770",
      "text": "Ms. Barboon."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:05:25.770",
      "end": "00:05:27.260",
      "text": "Thank you, through the chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:05:27.260",
      "end": "00:05:28.500",
      "text": "That is correct."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:05:28.500",
      "end": "00:05:30.450",
      "text": "One of the things that we've learned over time"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:05:30.450",
      "end": "00:05:33.360",
      "text": "is that markets can shift quite dramatically,"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:05:33.360",
      "end": "00:05:34.320",
      "text": "depending on the time."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:05:34.320",
      "end": "00:05:36.320",
      "text": "And nobody has a crystal ball to know"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:05:36.320",
      "end": "00:05:38.270",
      "text": "how the markets might shift over time."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:05:38.270",
      "end": "00:05:40.980",
      "text": "So traditionally, we have always been active"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:05:40.980",
      "end": "00:05:44.450",
      "text": "in the spring market, and the market expects the city"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:05:44.450",
      "end": "00:05:47.480",
      "text": "of London to look forward to initiatives at some point."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:05:47.480",
      "end": "00:05:51.470",
      "text": "So we certainly have opportunity with respect"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:05:51.470",
      "end": "00:05:54.110",
      "text": "to the amount that we issue to be able to ensure"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:05:54.110",
      "end": "00:05:57.460",
      "text": "that we stay within budget and don't have any concerns"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:05:57.460",
      "end": "00:06:03.520",
      "text": "with the total impact over the course of the term."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:06:03.520",
      "end": "00:06:09.070",
      "text": "And I also noticed that we have a 3.8 all-in rate"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:06:09.070",
      "end": "00:06:13.170",
      "text": "to average over 10 years, and that would protect us"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:06:13.170",
      "end": "00:06:16.570",
      "text": "against further volatility in the markets"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:06:16.570",
      "end": "00:06:18.400",
      "text": "in terms of the rates going up."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:06:18.400",
      "end": "00:06:23.850",
      "text": "This isn't variable, this is locked in."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:06:23.850",
      "end": "00:06:25.910",
      "text": "Ms. Barboon."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:06:25.910",
      "end": "00:06:30.510",
      "text": "Yeah, thank you, thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:06:30.510",
      "end": "00:06:32.980",
      "text": "Through the chair, I can confirm those are locked in rates."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:06:32.980",
      "end": "00:06:36.920",
      "text": "And if rates go up, certainly they are not a variable rate,"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:06:36.920",
      "end": "00:06:39.500",
      "text": "so it will be for the duration."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:06:39.500",
      "end": "00:06:42.090",
      "text": "And the debt is not callable,"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:06:42.090",
      "end": "00:06:45.150",
      "text": "so that will fulfill the term dates"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:06:45.150",
      "end": "00:06:48.840",
      "text": "as has been outlined in the report."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:06:48.840",
      "end": "00:06:52.530",
      "text": "Thank you for that, any other questions or comments?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:06:52.530",
      "end": "00:07:05.270",
      "text": "I see none, so I'll ask the clerk to open the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:07:05.270",
      "end": "00:07:09.400",
      "text": "Closing the vote, the motion's passed, five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:07:09.400",
      "end": "00:07:10.230",
      "text": "Thank you, colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:07:10.230",
      "end": "00:07:11.800",
      "text": "That concludes the agenda for the eighth"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:07:11.800",
      "end": "00:07:13.610",
      "text": "and special meeting of the Corporate Services Committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:07:13.610",
      "end": "00:07:16.170",
      "text": "We just need a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:07:16.170",
      "end": "00:07:17.500",
      "text": "Moved by Councilor McAllister"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:07:17.500",
      "end": "00:07:18.910",
      "text": "and seconded by Councilor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:07:18.910",
      "end": "00:07:23.230",
      "text": "All those in favor, by hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:07:23.230",
      "end": "00:07:25.570",
      "text": "The motion's passed."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:07:25.570",
      "end": "00:07:26.340",
      "text": "Thank you, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:07:26.340",
      "end": "00:07:28.150",
      "text": "And there's two special meetings today,"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:07:28.150",
      "end": "00:07:32.250",
      "text": "so if you're really wanting to get some more committee work in,"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:07:32.250",
      "end": "00:07:33.600",
      "text": "civic works is at 1 p.m."
    }
  ],
